# Bus shelter glass roof (one-way; top 4 px = walking surface): a k/i/d/k
# steel frame, below it a glass fascia h with two s reflection streaks per
# tile and a d lower rail with a k edge (rows 4..10); transparent below.
# End tiles get a k end and a d frame post. Only left/right bits matter.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_wartehaus_dach
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
